### Users (password "password"): alice (HR), carol (Software Development), bob (IT, salary), admin (everything)
### Fields are paths from "root": department.name, manager.fullName, trainingRecords.training.name, ...

### Catalog: entities, the fields this user may use and the relations to navigate
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/catalog
Authorization: Basic alice password

### Many-to-one + GROUP BY + HAVING: departments with >= 3 people, by average salary
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reports/run
Authorization: Basic admin password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "root": "Personnel",
  "columns": [
    {"field": "department.name"},
    {"aggregate": "COUNT", "label": "Headcount"},
    {"field": "salary", "aggregate": "AVG", "label": "Average Salary"}
  ],
  "where":  {"field": "active", "operator": "EQ", "value": true},
  "having": {"aggregate": "COUNT", "operator": "GTE", "value": 3},
  "sort":   [{"field": "salary", "aggregate": "AVG", "direction": "DESC"}]
}

### Self-reference: everyone with their manager and their manager's department
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reports/run?page=0&size=50
Authorization: Basic admin password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "root": "Personnel",
  "columns": [{"field": "fullName"}, {"field": "manager.fullName"}, {"field": "manager.department.name"}],
  "sort": [{"field": "fullName"}]
}

### Many-to-many with junction fields: renewals due within 30 days (carol only sees her department)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reports/run
Authorization: Basic carol password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "root": "TrainingRecord",
  "columns": [
    {"field": "personnel.fullName"}, {"field": "training.name"},
    {"field": "nextRenewalDate"}, {"field": "personnel.department.name"}
  ],
  "where": {"conditions": [
    {"field": "nextRenewalDate", "operator": "NEXT_N_DAYS", "value": 30},
    {"field": "training.mandatory", "operator": "EQ", "value": true}
  ]},
  "sort": [{"field": "nextRenewalDate"}]
}

### Pure many-to-many + nested OR: people knowing Kubernetes or Java, hired after 2018
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reports/run
Authorization: Basic admin password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "root": "Personnel",
  "columns": [{"field": "fullName"}, {"field": "skills.skill.name"}],
  "where": {"conditions": [
    {"field": "skills.skill.name", "operator": "IN", "value": ["Kubernetes", "Java"]},
    {"field": "hireDate", "operator": "GTE", "value": "2018-01-01"}
  ]},
  "sort": [{"field": "fullName"}]
}

### Across modules: total allocation per project and owning department
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reports/run
Authorization: Basic admin password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "root": "ProjectAssignment",
  "columns": [
    {"field": "project.name"}, {"field": "project.department.name"},
    {"aggregate": "COUNT", "label": "People"},
    {"field": "allocationPercent", "aggregate": "SUM", "label": "Total Allocation (%)"}
  ],
  "sort": [{"field": "allocationPercent", "aggregate": "SUM", "direction": "DESC"}]
}

### Date grouping: assignments per month in 2025 (dateGroup: YEAR, QUARTER, MONTH, DAY, QUARTER_OF_YEAR, MONTH_OF_YEAR)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reports/run
Authorization: Basic admin password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "root": "ProjectAssignment",
  "columns": [
    {"field": "assignedOn", "dateGroup": "MONTH"},
    {"aggregate": "COUNT", "label": "Assignments"},
    {"field": "allocationPercent", "aggregate": "SUM"}
  ],
  "where": {"field": "assignedOn", "dateGroup": "YEAR", "operator": "EQ", "value": 2025},
  "sort": [{"field": "assignedOn", "dateGroup": "MONTH"}]
}

### Date grouping: hires per year
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reports/run
Authorization: Basic admin password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "root": "Personnel",
  "columns": [{"field": "hireDate", "dateGroup": "YEAR"}, {"aggregate": "COUNT", "label": "Hires"}],
  "sort": [{"field": "hireDate", "dateGroup": "YEAR"}]
}

### 400: would inflate SUM(salary) through the one-to-many trainingRecords join
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reports/run
Authorization: Basic admin password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "root": "Personnel",
  "columns": [{"field": "trainingRecords.training.name"}, {"field": "salary", "aggregate": "SUM"}]
}

### Streaming CSV export
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reports/export
Authorization: Basic admin password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "root": "Personnel",
  "columns": [{"field": "fullName"}, {"field": "department.name"}, {"field": "profile.city"}, {"field": "salary"}]
}

### Generated SQL (REPORT_ADMIN only)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reports/preview
Authorization: Basic admin password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "root": "Department",
  "columns": [{"field": "name"}, {"field": "parent.name"}, {"field": "manager.fullName"}, {"field": "members.fullName"}]
}
